              "question": "<p>Choose the stimulant laxative(s) that is/are effective if taken orally, by suppository, or by enema.&nbsp;</p>\n"
            },
            "library": "H5P.MultiChoice 1.16",
            "metadata": {
              "contentType": "Multiple Choice",
